---
description: External component/effect sources must be evaluated before integration
globs:
  - "**/*.tsx"
  - "**/*.jsx"
  - "**/*.css"
  - "**/*.scss"
  - "**/*.blade.php"
---

When using external components/effects:
- prefer approved sources in `shared/external-sources/registry.json`
- check framework compatibility and existing project dependencies
- check license before copying code
- avoid dependency duplication
- adapt to current design system
- verify accessibility, reduced motion and performance
